DG-LAB Coyote 3.0 support

opentoys implements the Bluetooth protocol for the DG-LAB Coyote 3.0 published at
https://github.com/dungeonlab-open/dglab-bluetooth-protocol. DG-LAB asks that its published protocol content not
be used for any commercial purpose without its authorisation, and invites anyone interested in commercial
cooperation to contact it. The opentoys licence does not grant permission to use DG-LAB's content.


